{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日はいよいよ、ライブですね!\n一年かあ。\nとても早かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この1年でメンバーみんなの事をよく知れた気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも仲良しでいたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルってグループ内で、バチバチしてるものかと思っていましたが、欅坂にはバチバチがありせん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな優しくて、それぞれ頑張っています。\n色んないい所が一年で発見できました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3JYXSCK2Y3TPQ9T4YDTMJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nレッスンがんばるでい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハマっていること･･･外食。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近食べた美味しかったものを載せます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3K0Y4P75YVSH1T3HJE1J0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3K4VMY97HF6KWQXEJW9C2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n雪見だいふく大好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソラマチの栃木イチゴアイス。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3K6FHH1QEYCW5DC4HYT7Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抹茶ソルビン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3K814MRB6NDDJDDC9RWKW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここのところは、セブンイレブンの チーズインチーズ のソフトクリームを毎日食べてます。\nやみつきでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}